  "body": "The nodejs streams working group is planing on having a working group meeting tentatively scheduled for next Monday (nodejs/readable-stream#183) and anyone working on whatwg streams who wants to is more then welcome to join the meeting. The streams WG would really benefit to know, what is nailed down vs what is still up in the air on your end and to get your perspective on how problems we need to solve in node streams were solved in whatwg streams.\n",
